<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-700 to-orange-500 min-h-screen">
<div class="space-y-8">
<h1 class="text-3xl font-mono underline">Deployment Options</h1>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-mono underline mt-4 mb-4">These are some options for deploying your apps to the web.</h2>
<ul class="space-y-8">
  <li>
     <%= link_to "Heroku", "https://www.heroku.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
      <h2 class="text-xl">-Heroku is a platform as a service (PaaS) that enables developers to build, run, and operate applications entirely in the cloud.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Vercel", "https://www.vercel.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Your complete platform for the web. Vercel provides the developer tools and cloud infrastructure to build, scale, and secure a faster, more personalized web.</h2>
  </li>
  <li>
     <%= link_to "Netlify", "https://www.netlify.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Netlify is the essential platform for the delivery of exceptional and dynamic web experiences, without limitations.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Firebase", "https://firebase.google.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Discover Firebase, Google's mobile and web app development platform that helps developers build apps and games that users will love.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "GitHub Pages", "https://pages.github.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
     <h2 class="text-xl">-Build your own site from scratch or generate one for your project. You get one site per GitHub account and organization, and unlimited project sites.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Amazon Web Services", "https://aws.amazon.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Start Building Now at No Cost — Build, Deploy, and Manage Websites, Apps or Processes on AWS Secure, Reliable Network.</h2>
  </li>
  <li>
     <%= link_to "DigitalOcean", "https://www.digitalocean.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-DigitalOcean Droplets are simple, scalable virtual machines for all your web hosting and VPS hosting needs.</h2>
  </li>
  <li>
     <%= link_to "Railway", "https://www.railway.app", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Railway is an infrastructure platform where you can provision infrastructure, develop with that infrastructure locally, and then deploy to the cloud.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Surge", "https://www.surge.sh", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">-Static web publishing for Front-End Developers. Simple, single-command web publishing. Publish HTML , CSS , and JS for free, without leaving the command line.</h2>
  </li>
   <li>
     <%= link_to "Render", "https://render.com", class: "font-mono text-2xl hover:text-white", target: :_blank, rel: "noreferrer" %>
    <h2 class="text-xl">On Render, you can build, deploy, and scale your apps with unparalleled ease – from your first user to your billionth.</h2>
  </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
